# Pairs with ChainCoversCommitted. The increment looks up only the sagas whose
# records reach its window. A saga undecided at the full base, all of whose
# prepares precede the base's frontier, commits; before its terminals land an
# increment holds it committed in d0 yet restores it pre-saga.
MODULE: ChainCoversCommittedBaseUndecidedIgnored
TARGET: ChainCoversCommitted
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the sagas the base held as undecided are not looked up

--- FIND
Tracked == InWindow \/ Last.und
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the base's undecided sagas are not tracked.
Tracked == InWindow
--- END
